  "description": "The Rufus Stone is our first offering here at Rune Bicycles, and we wanted to start strong. Designed as a true jack of all trades, it’s equally at home loaded up for a short tour, ripping around on the weekend, or just getting you to work in style.\nComfort and aesthetics were at the heart of the design. The Rufus Stone rides smooth and stable, with a geometry that feels good whether you're spinning all day or dodging traffic. And while it’s built to handle real-world riding, it doesn’t hurt that it looks damn good doing it.\nThis is the kind of bike that becomes a daily favourite not because it’s flashy, but because it just works, wherever and however you ride.",
